      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c2f5434e10cd7317fce9d5c|full_name}: Those FBT apps don't run in the background. They remain open with your phone on a stand somewhere pointed at your body while you use another device. Such as your quest. So I'm confused what you mean by \"like a few FBT apps on phones nowadays\"",
