      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{619ffdfe00e2a864e7efb2e1|full_name}: My meaning was that VRChat adding OSC trackers made people develop dedicated apps for it.\n\nWhile it isn't as obvious that it is possible, eventually there will be dedicated face tracking apps for android VRChat.\n\nWhile people developing such apps will definitely have to fight against the garbage collector, if it works well enough then there will be options.",
